 take advantage by seizing the center immediately.\n\nReason: I choose **e7-e5** because it:\n- Occupies the center with a pawn\n- Opens lines for my f8-bishop and d8-queen\n- Prepares for natural development (Nf6, Bc5/e7)\n- Is the most principled response regardless of White's unusual a4 move\n- Maintains maximum flexibility for my position\n\nAnswer: P: e7-e5"}
