4-e1 is indeed checkmate:\n- Queen on e1 attacks king on f1\n- King cannot move to e2 (controlled by queen)\n- King cannot move to g1 (controlled by queen)  \n- King cannot move to g2 (blocked by pawn on h2)\n- No piece can capture the queen on e1\n- No piece can block the check\n\nReason: Q: h4-e1 delivers immediate checkmate. The white king on f1 is trapped with no escape squares and no way to block or capture the checking piece.\n\nAnswer: Q: h4-e1"}
