uring it with my king (K: g8-g7) removes a dangerous attacking piece from my position while also activating my king slightly. This is clearly the most forcing and beneficial move available, as leaving that bishop on g7 would allow White to maintain severe pressure on my kingside. Material is roughly equal, so removing this well-placed enemy piece is paramount.\n\nAnswer: K: g8-g7"}
