es.\n\nReason: B: e1-c3 creates a powerful double attack (fork) on both the knight on a5 and the rook on b3. White cannot save both pieces, guaranteeing material gain. This is a concrete tactical blow that wins material immediately, which is the most direct path to converting this position into a win.\n\nAnswer: B: e1-c3"}
