sure and restricts White's options. In an endgame with such a material advantage, actively coordinating my pieces and restricting the opponent's king is the most efficient path to victory. The check forces White's hand and allows me to continue improving my position while keeping White on the defensive.\n\nAnswer: R: e2-b2"}
