 is the strongest move. It gives check, forcing White's king to move to d2, e2, or c2. This accomplishes multiple goals:\n- Restricts the White king's mobility\n- Controls the critical first rank\n- Maintains my rook's activity\n- After the king moves, I can continue with king activation and systematic pawn advances\n\nThis check gains tempo and improves my position before methodically converting my material advantage.\n\nAnswer: R: h2-h1"}
